note E13 unknown-base/address control. Public runtime i is not an exact constant, so the secret
note store's address may hit the count range and must revoke it. The bounds check itself stays len.
fn f c edit uchar 104 a view uchar 1 i ulong to ulong
put c i get a 0
if eq get c 32 0
ret 0
else
ret 1
end
end
